I am slightly worried about the fact that your fcs files don't contain  
a $DATATYPE keyword, which is mandatory according to the FCS specs.  
That said, fhe fact that some instrument manufacturers don't adhere to  
this standard is no news, and we have invested some efforts to allow  
for these inconsistencies during file import. If you could send one of  
the offending FCS files I will take a look and see what can be done.
Florian


